    "detailed_description": "<h1>Burn it!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454750/extras/56029c05b431abba84dfae5b9ad3624c.poster.avif?t=1753042462\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454750/extras/56029c05b431abba84dfae5b9ad3624c.webm?t=1753042462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454750/extras/56029c05b431abba84dfae5b9ad3624c.mp4?t=1753042462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Liekki is a fast-paced puzzle platformer where you play as a small fire spirit and burn everything you touch. You can solve levels with trying to burn everything or very little. Solve puzzles and move through a strange world with different fire related powers and find secrets. Levels change when you burn objects within and if you are not careful, you might miss something.",
    "about_the_game": "Liekki is a fast-paced puzzle platformer where you play as a small fire spirit and burn everything you touch. You can solve levels with trying to burn everything or very little. Solve puzzles and move through a strange world with different fire related powers and find secrets. Levels change when you burn objects within and if you are not careful, you might miss something.",
    "short_description": "Liekki is a fast-paced puzzle platformer where you play as a little fire spirit and try to burn as much as possible \u2013 or as little as possible. Solve levels using different fire related powers and change levels while burning them down.",
